        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Alright, can confirm this is the case:\r\n![image](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/assets/1961154/c995cf2a-1582-46a2-9303-1e7b9cdd0cac)\r\nThough it seems like 100 isn't as high as would be usable. 100 filters a lot more files than just those SQL Files. I don't really care though, as file-name is good enough in 99.99% of cases for me. I'll leave the max-columns configuration, as it's more universally usable for me.",
            "created_at": "2023-10-17T11:55:20Z",
